{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七廉切標也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阻力切與側同仄身謂不安處也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僶弭盡切\n俛美辨切僶俛猶勉強也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "肯苦等切綮棄󲊸切肯綮骨肉會處也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "失冉切州名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "芳無切郭也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "逗正作讀大透切凡經書文語絕處\n謂之句語未絕點之以便誦詠謂之讀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "賔彌切附益也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "徉遵切順也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "王矩切天地四方曰㝢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "力踵切丘壟也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "髫徒凋切小兒髻也\n齓初覲切毀齒也"}
